      "options": { "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false }, "content": "### Measurement conditions\n\n- Measurements use the **Ookla Speedtest CLI** from the Raspberry Pi's wired `eth0` interface.\n- The test server is fixed to **IPA CyberLab 400G, Tokyo, Japan** (server ID `48463`) so the series remains comparable.\n- A full download and upload test runs **every 30 minutes**. It intentionally uses substantial bandwidth and represents the internet connection from the wired Pi location, not Wi-Fi throughput.", "mode": "markdown" }, "pluginVersion": "13.2.2", "title": "About this measurement", "type": "text"
